      <a href="/blog/ollama-now-supports-jev-style-decision-models" class="group border-b py-10">
        <h2
          class="mb-1 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight group-hover:underline md:text-2xl"
        >
          Ollama now supports Jev-style decision models
        </h2>
        <h3 datetime="2026-09-29 00:00:00 &#43;0000 UTC" class="text-sm text-neutral-500">
          September 29, 2026
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg">Ollama now supports decision models, based on TypeSafe&#39;s Jev API for fast, typed decisions. Decision models can now be run at no cost with low latency. Based on text, decision models answer yes-or-no questions, choices and scores about it, with a probability for every option.</p>
      </a>
    
