        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg">Meta&#39;s Code Llama is now available on Ollama to try.</p>
      </a>
    
      <a href="/blog/run-llama2-uncensored-locally" class="group border-b py-10">
        <h2
          class="mb-1 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight group-hover:underline md:text-2xl"
